    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6ecb51e76ed31d22260a966",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可以是可以……\n但我没有打算做什么特别的事情喔，\n真的只是在闲晃而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04a1a5b75145e851fca33297d0bac667f90df1425174dd8c89986a5ece198b06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
