      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但现在家里只剩下爸爸和妈妈，\n他们或许会像回到情侣时代那样，\n卿卿我我地过圣诞节呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f04b850906755f2bb1b067c916e5eaed36d757b08243b5a1d3b132b4fae760de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
